    "type": "markdown",
    "content": "### Colour\nThe four presets \u2014 **default, warm, cool, mono** \u2014 ignore the sliders below. Set **Theme** to **custom** first, then they take effect immediately, no reflash.\n\n*Intensity* is the ring's brightness for that element, not the screen's. The screen reuses the same hue at its own brightness, because a bare LED and a backlit panel don't want the same value.\n\nThe status **pips** follow the timer arc at 62% and have no separate control. **mono** pins every saturation to zero and is the accessible palette \u2014 custom never leaks into it."
